    "agendaChanges": "Measure U Funds Disbursement (originally consent item 7.4) was pulled and moved to Action Items as item 7.4. Within item 7.4, Hoover and Taft allocations were further pulled by the Superintendent for return at a future meeting, so the vote approved all schools except Hoover and Taft. The formal agenda lists no Section 8 action items, but 7.4 effectively became one. Sections 2 (Welcome by Janet Lawson) and the roll call under Section 1 proceeded in order; Section 2 welcome was not separately conducted beyond the president opening the meeting.",
